# Netlify redirects for concretecoatingtechnology.com (also copied into preview builds).
# Every legacy URL points straight at its final destination: no redirect chains.
# Retired service URLs are forced (301!) so a static file at the old path can never shadow the rule.
# Both slash forms are listed so the rule applies however the old URL was linked.

# Legacy aliases carried over from the previous site.
# No /contact-us -> /contact-us/ rule: Netlify ignores trailing slashes when matching rules,
# so that rule matched its own target and returned 403 for the Contact page (verified with netlify dev).
# Netlify's built-in pretty-URL handling already serves /contact-us/ for /contact-us.
/home/                                    /             301

# Service pages consolidated into Concrete Floor Coatings on /services/ (November 2026)
/services/concrete-repair-maintenance/    /services/    301!
/services/concrete-repair-maintenance     /services/    301!
/services/protective-concrete-overlays/   /services/    301!
/services/protective-concrete-overlays    /services/    301!
/services/decorative-concrete-overlays/   /services/    301!
/services/decorative-concrete-overlays    /services/    301!
/services/concrete-overlay/               /services/    301!
/services/concrete-overlay                /services/    301!
/concrete-overlay/                        /services/    301!
/concrete-overlay                         /services/    301!

# Old epoxy blog category: epoxy floor coatings are the consolidated service
/category/epoxy-flooring/                 /services/    301!
/category/epoxy-flooring                  /services/    301!

